  "description": "FULL SPEED AHEAD\n\nThe Voytek 2 is made for going fast on snowy trails with more confidence. It is a fat bike that handles like a mountain bike on snowy singletrack thanks to an extremely narrow Q factor. With XC MTB geometry, a lightweight carbon fiber frame, adjustable geomentry, and clearance for 27.5\" x 4.5\" (or 26\" x 4.6\") tires, it is ready to rip your local trails.\n\nUsing a 120mm suspension fork will slacken the head tube angle by 0.5º",
